base='''Use case: precise-object-edit. Asset: native detailed seamless Q Daoist fishing-village terrain patch. Produce exactly one opaque square image, same 1254 by 1254 framing and view as IMAGE 4. Image1 is approved world layout, Image2 is independent style only, Image3 is primary painterly style only. IMAGE 4 IS THE ACTUAL EDIT TARGET. Do not render any full-map overview, UI, text, labels, rulers or borders. Retain crisp polished rounded daylight painting and warm golden sand, with small irregular painterly flecks. No new props or buildings. Preserve the outer margins and exact existing object locations except where explicitly correcting broken geometry. No characters.\n'''
